IMAPAccount yahoo
Host imap.mail.yahoo.com
Port 993
User vorbster@yahoo.com          # full email address
# Prefer PassCmd over plain Pass
PassCmd "security find-internet-password   -s imap.mail.yahoo.com   -a vorbster@yahoo.com   -w"
# Pass "your-app-password-here"  # only for quick testing
TLSType IMAPS
# CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt   # uncomment if needed
Timeout 60
PipelineDepth 50
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore yahoo-remote
Account yahoo

MaildirStore yahoo-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.local/share/mail/yahoo/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/yahoo/INBOX

Channel yahoo
Far :yahoo-remote:
Near :yahoo-local:
Patterns *                       # sync everything; restrict if desired
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
CopyArrivalDate yes
